msgid "Bootloader, removed boards and features *(tooling)*"
msgstr "Startladdare, borttagna kort och funktioner *(tooling)*"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.6.0.rst:190
msgid ""
"The legacy CDC bootloader was replaced by a new TinyUSB-based **standard "
"DFU** bootloader on all boards — the firmware-update mechanism changed; "
"update your flashing workflow/tooling accordingly. The **OpenMV Pro** board,"
" the standalone **Raspberry Pi Pico** build, and the WiFi-debug "
"(``wifidbg``) remote-IDE feature were removed."
msgstr ""
"Den äldre CDC-startladdaren ersattes av en ny TinyUSB-baserad **standard-"
"DFU**\\ -startladdare på alla kort — mekanismen för uppdatering av fast "
"programvara ändrades; uppdatera ditt flashnings-arbetsflöde/verktyg "
"därefter. Kortet **OpenMV Pro**\\ , det fristående **Raspberry Pi Pico**\\ "
"-bygget och fjärr-IDE-funktionen WiFi-felsökning (\\ ``wifidbg``\\ ) togs "
"bort."

